{
  "id": "27798_sudatsu",
  "headword": "{巣立|すだ}つ",
  "reading": "すだつ",
  "romaji": "sudatsu",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to leave the nest; to set out on one's own",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to leave the nest; to set out on one's own",
      "explanation": "Of a young bird, to fly from the nest; by extension, of a child or graduate, to become independent and go out into the world."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "27798_sudatsu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{鳥|とり}→鳥：00679_tori⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧ひな⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{巣立|すだ}つ。",
      "english": "The chicks leave the nest.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27798_sudatsu_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{子供|こども}→子供：00554_kodomo⟧たち⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧みな{巣立|すだ}っていった。",
      "english": "The children have all gone out on their own.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27798_sudatsu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦この→この：00962_kono⟧⟦{学校|がっこう}→学校：00055_gakkou⟧⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧{多|おお}く⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{音楽家|おんがくか}→音楽家：27511_ongakuka⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{巣立|すだ}っていった。",
      "english": "Many musicians have gone out into the world from this school.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Intransitive godan verb. X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{巣立|すだ}つ.\n\nLiterally of a bird leaving the nest; very commonly used figuratively of children leaving home or students graduating into adult life.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{学校|がっこう}→学校：00055_gakkou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{巣立|すだ}つ: to graduate and go out into the world\n- ⟦{社会|しゃかい}→社会：01427_shakai⟧⟦へ→へ：02473_he⟧{巣立|すだ}つ: to set out into society\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{独立|どくりつ}→独立：03488_dokuritsu⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to become independent — neutral; lacks the nurturing 'raised and released' nuance\n- ⟦{卒業|そつぎょう}→卒業：01643_sotsugyou⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to graduate — the formal completion of schooling",
